            "type": "heading"
          },
          {
            "alignment": "justify",
            "content": [
              {
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Sans",
                "fontSize": 11,
                "text": "A junior surveyor catalogued three disputed boundary stones after several rounds of discussion. The harbour committee compared the sluice gate mechanism with unusual care. The grain exchange approved last season's tonnage figures according to the standing orders.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-13",
            "spaceAfter": 8,
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "bold": true,
                "color": "#2f5496",
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Serif",
                "fontSize": 13,
                "text": "Scope of the survey",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-14",
            "level": 2,
            "styleId": "paragraph-style-2",
            "type": "heading"
          },
          {
            "alignment": "justify",
            "content": [
              {
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Sans",
                "fontSize": 11,
                "text": "The regional council recorded the eastern jetty in time for the autumn meeting. Local fishing crews rebuilt the winter storage sheds and filed the result in triplicate. A visiting engineer compared an index of local pilots in time for the autumn meeting.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-15",
            "spaceAfter": 8,
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "bold": true,
                "color": "#2f5496",
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Serif",
                "fontSize": 13,
                "text": "Method",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-16",
            "level": 2,
            "styleId": "paragraph-style-2",
            "type": "heading"
          },
          {
            "alignment": "justify",
            "content": [
              {
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Sans",
                "fontSize": 11,
                "text": "An experienced pilot compared the dredging contract while the market was closed. The harbour committee compared last season's tonnage figures during the long spring inspection. The tide almanac repainted the dredging contract and filed the result in triplicate.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-17",
            "spaceAfter": 8,
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "bold": true,
                "color": "#2f5496",
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Serif",
                "fontSize": 16,
                "text": "Findings",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-18",
            "level": 1,
            "styleId": "paragraph-style-1",
            "type": "heading"
          },
          {
            "alignment": "justify",
            "content": [
              {
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Sans",
                "fontSize": 11,
                "text": "Several market traders catalogued two dozen mooring rings in the presence of two witnesses. The bridge authority rebuilt three disputed boundary stones as the tide turned. Our records office inspected a draft of the annual report before the first frost.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-19",
            "spaceAfter": 8,
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "bold": true,
                "color": "#2f5496",
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Serif",
                "fontSize": 13,
                "text": "Tonnage",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-20",
            "level": 2,
            "styleId": "paragraph-style-2",
            "type": "heading"
          },
          {
            "alignment": "justify",
            "content": [
              {
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Sans",
                "fontSize": 11,
                "text": "A careful archivist measured a bundle of weathered charts according to the standing orders. A junior surveyor compared the ferry timetable before the first frost. The northern ferry service catalogued two dozen mooring rings using only the instruments on hand.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-21",
            "spaceAfter": 8,
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "bold": true,
                "color": "#1f3763",
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Serif",
                "fontSize": 12,
                "text": "Seasonal variation",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-22",
            "level": 3,
            "styleId": "paragraph-style-2",
            "type": "heading"
          },
          {
            "alignment": "justify",
            "content": [
              {
                "fontFamily": "Liberation Sans",
                "fontSize": 11,
                "text": "The bridge authority reorganised the lamp oil inventory before the first frost. The bridge authority rebuilt two dozen mooring rings without waiting for approval. Every lighthouse keeper postponed every outstanding repair order to the satisfaction of nobody in particular.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-23",
            "spaceAfter": 8,
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [
